{"id": "d4e613e6-fbeb-49c3-8c54-fadc06f860cc", "slug": "instant-digital-content-section", "title": "Instant Digital Content Section", "description": "Instant Digital Content Section is designed for structuring key content in a full-width page block. Key features include clear structure, reusable styling patterns, and production-ready layout behavior. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for component libraries and responsive web projects. Interaction states are des", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-top-creators-featured\"\nname: \"Instant Digital Content Section\"\ndescription: \"Instant Digital Content Section is designed for structuring key content in a full-width page block. Key features include clear structure, reusable styling patterns, and production-ready layout behavior. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for component libraries and responsive web projects. Interaction states are des\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#0A0A0A\"\n  secondary: \"#0F0F0F\"\n  accent: \"#0A0A0A\"\n  background: \"#0A0A0A\"\n  surface: \"#18181B\"\n  text-primary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  text-secondary: \"#A1A1AA\"\n  border: \"#27272A\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"8px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Instant Digital Content Section\nSource: Neuform Featured templates from top creators. Author: Meng To (@mengto). Views: 17; favorites: 9; remixes: 4.\nTags: section, charts, bento, animated, webgl, threejs, cta, navigation.\n## Overview\nInstant Digital Content Section is designed for structuring key content in a full-width page block. Key features include clear structure, reusable styling patterns, and production-ready layout behavior. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for component libraries and responsive web projects. Interaction states are des\n\nExperience a fluid, 3D orbiting interface designed for visionary creators to manage and showcase digital assets.\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Your vision,; instantly realized..\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #0A0A0A, secondary #0F0F0F, accent #0A0A0A, background #0A0A0A, surface #18181B, text-primary #FFFFFF. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and Inter for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nDashboard, chart, and data panels should preserve their compact operational hierarchy, nested surfaces, and metric emphasis.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Visionary - Instant Catalog</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-[#0a0a0a] text-white font-sans min-h-screen relative overflow-hidden selection:bg-white selection:text-black\">\n\n    <!-- WebGL-like Canvas Background -->\n    <canvas id=\"bg-canvas\" class=\"absolute inset-0 z-0 pointer-events-none opacity-40\"></canvas>\n\n    <!-- Header -->\n    <header class=\"absolute top-6 left-6 right-6 flex justify-between items-center z-40\">\n        <!-- Logo -->\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n            <div class=\"w-8 h-8 bg-white rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center\">\n                <div class=\"w-3 h-3 bg-black rounded-full\"></div>\n            </div>\n            <span class=\"text-xs font-normal tracking-tight\">VISIONARY®</span>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Center Nav -->\n        <nav class=\"hidden md:flex items-center gap-6 bg-white/5 border border-white/10 backdrop-blur-md text-gray-200 px-5 py-2.5 rounded-full text-sm font-normal shadow-lg\">\n            <button class=\"flex items-center gap-2 hover:text-white transition-colors\">\n                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:hamburger-menu-linear\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" class=\"text-lg\"></iconify-icon>\n                Menu\n            </button>\n            <div class=\"w-px h-4 bg-white/20\"></div>\n            <button class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors flex items-center\">\n                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:moon-linear\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" class=\"text-lg\"></iconify-icon>\n            </button>\n            <div class=\"w-px h-4 bg-white/20\"></div>\n            <span class=\"text-gray-500\">0%</span>\n        </nav>\n\n        <!-- Right Actions -->\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\">\n            <button class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full border border-white/10 flex items-center justify-center hover:border-white/30 transition-colors bg-white/5 backdrop-blur-sm\">\n                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:user-linear\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" class=\"text-lg\"></iconify-icon>\n            </button>\n            <!-- Border Gradient Skill Applied -->\n            <button class=\"relative inline-flex items-center justify-center px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-normal text-white bg-black rounded-full hover:bg-white/5 transition-colors group before:absolute before:inset-0 before:p-[1px] before:bg-gradient-to-b before:from-white/40 before:to-white/5 before:rounded-full before:[mask:linear-gradient(#fff_0_0)_content-box,linear-gradient(#fff_0_0)] before:[mask-composite:exclude] before:[-webkit-mask:linear-gradient(#fff_0_0)_content-box,linear-gradient(#fff_0_0)] before:[-webkit-mask-composite:xor] before:pointer-events-none shadow-lg\">\n                Get started\n            </button>\n        </div>\n    </header>\n\n    <!-- Right Side Navigation -->\n    <nav class=\"hidden lg:flex absolute right-8 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 flex-col gap-2 z-40\">\n        <button class=\"px-4 py-2 rounded-full border border-white/10 text-xs font-normal text-gray-400 hover:text-white hover:border-white/30 transition-all bg-black/50 backdrop-blur-sm\">Campaigns</button>\n        <button class=\"px-4 py-2 rounded-full border border-white/20 text-xs font-normal text-white bg-white/10 shadow-sm transition-all backdrop-blur-sm\">Social Media</button>\n        <button class=\"px-4 py-2 rounded-full border border-white/10 text-xs font-normal text-gray-400 hover:text-white hover:border-white/30 transition-all bg-black/50 backdrop-blur-sm\">Lookbooks</button>\n        <button class=\"px-4 py-2 rounded-full border border-white/10 text-xs font-normal text-gray-400 hover:text-white hover:border-white/30 transition-all bg-black/50 backdrop-blur-sm\">E-commerce</button>\n        <button class=\"px-4 py-2 rounded-full border border-white/10 text-xs font-normal text-gray-400 hover:text-white hover:border-white/30 transition-all bg-black/50 backdrop-blur-sm\">Community</button>\n    </nav>\n\n    <!-- Main Content Area with 3D Perspective -->\n    <main class=\"absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center z-10 overflow-hidden\" style=\"perspective: 1200px; transform-style: preserve-3d;\">\n        <div class=\"relative w-full h-full flex items-center justify-center\" style=\"transform-style: preserve-3d;\">\n\n            <!-- Central Dropzone with Border Gradient Skill -->\n            <div class=\"absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-28 h-28 md:w-36 md:h-36 bg-[#0f0f0f] rounded-[2rem] flex flex-col items-center justify-center shadow-[0_8px_30px_rgb(0,0,0,0.4)] z-[50] before:absolute before:inset-0 before:p-[1px] before:bg-gradient-to-br before:from-white/30 before:to-white/5 before:rounded-[2rem] before:[mask:linear-gradient(#fff_0_0)_content-box,linear-gradient(#fff_0_0)] before:[mask-composite:exclude] before:[-webkit-mask:linear-gradient(#fff_0_0)_content-box,linear-gradient(#fff_0_0)] before:[-webkit-mask-composite:xor] before:pointer-events-none hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500 cursor-pointer group\">\n                <div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-white/5 flex items-center justify-center mb-2 group-hover:bg-white/10 transition-colors\">\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:paperclip-linear\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" class=\"text-xl text-gray-300\"></iconify-icon>\n                </div>\n                <span class=\"text-xs text-gray-400 font-normal text-center px-4 leading-tight\">Upload or drop<br>your assets</span>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- 3D Orbiting Images -->\n            <div class=\"gallery-item absolute top-1/2 left-1/2\" style=\"perspective: 1000px; will-change: transform, opacity, z-index;\">\n                <img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1581403341630-a6e0b9d2d257?ixid=M3w3NTc5NzN8MHwxfHNlYXJjaHwxMnx8cG9ydHJhaXR8ZW58MXwxfHx8MTc3MjY2OTU0NXww&amp;ixlib=rb-4.1.0&amp;w=320&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format&amp;q=80\" alt=\"Fashion 1\" class=\"w-20 h-28 md:w-28 md:h-36 object-cover rounded-[1.5rem] md:rounded-[2rem] shadow-2xl grayscale-[20%] hover:grayscale-0 transition-all duration-500\" style=\"will-change: transform;\">\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"gallery-item absolute top-1/2 left-1/2\" style=\"perspective: 1000px; will-change: transform, opacity, z-index;\">\n                <img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1485893086445-ed75865251e0?ixid=M3w3NTc5NzN8MHwxfHNlYXJjaHwxMHx8cG9ydHJhaXR8ZW58MXwyfHx8MTc3MjY2OTU0M3ww&amp;ixlib=rb-4.1.0&amp;w=320&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format&amp;q=80\" alt=\"Fashion 2\" class=\"w-24 h-24 md:w-32 md:h-32 object-cover rounded-[1.5rem] md:rounded-[2rem] shadow-2xl grayscale-[20%] hover:grayscale-0 transition-all duration-500\" style=\"will-change: transform;\">\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"gallery-item absolute top-1/2 left-1/2\" style=\"perspective: 1000px; will-change: transform, opacity, z-index;\">\n                <img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1483985988355-763728e1935b?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;q=80&amp;w=300&amp;h=400\" alt=\"Fashion 3\" class=\"w-20 h-28 md:w-28 md:h-36 object-cover rounded-[1.5rem] md:rounded-[2rem] shadow-2xl grayscale-[20%] hover:grayscale-0 transition-all duration-500\" style=\"will-change: transform;\">\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"gallery-item absolute top-1/2 left-1/2\" style=\"perspective: 1000px; will-change: transform, opacity, z-index;\">\n                <img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1618077360395-f3068be8e001?ixid=M3w3NTc5NzN8MHwxfHNlYXJjaHw2fHxwb3J0cmFpdHxlbnwxfDJ8fHwxNzcyNjY5NTQzfDA&amp;ixlib=rb-4.1.0&amp;w=320&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format&amp;q=80\" alt=\"Fashion 4\" class=\"w-24 h-24 md:w-32 md:h-32 object-cover rounded-[1.5rem] md:rounded-[2rem] shadow-2xl grayscale-[20%] hover:grayscale-0 transition-all duration-500\" style=\"will-change: transform;\">\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"gallery-item absolute top-1/2 left-1/2\" style=\"perspective: 1000px; will-change: transform, opacity, z-index;\">\n                <img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1588117260148-b47818741c74?ixid=M3w3NTc5NzN8MHwxfHNlYXJjaHwyMXx8ZmFzaGlvbnxlbnwxfDF8fHwxNzcyNjY5NTY0fDA&amp;ixlib=rb-4.1.0&amp;w=320&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format&amp;q=80\" alt=\"Fashion 5\" class=\"w-20 h-28 md:w-28 md:h-36 object-cover rounded-[1.5rem] md:rounded-[2rem] shadow-2xl grayscale-[20%] hover:grayscale-0 transition-all duration-500\" style=\"will-change: transform;\">\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"gallery-item absolute top-1/2 left-1/2\" style=\"perspective: 1000px; will-change: transform, opacity, z-index;\">\n                <img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1718964312487-d5e3d56fd2ce?ixid=M3w3NTc5NzN8MHwxfHNlYXJjaHwzMXx8ZmFzaGlvbnxlbnwxfDJ8fHwxNzcyNjY5NTY5fDA&amp;ixlib=rb-4.1.0&amp;w=320&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format&amp;q=80\" alt=\"Fashion 6\" class=\"w-24 h-24 md:w-32 md:h-32 object-cover rounded-[1.5rem] md:rounded-[2rem] shadow-2xl grayscale-[20%] hover:grayscale-0 transition-all duration-500\" style=\"will-change: transform;\">\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"gallery-item absolute top-1/2 left-1/2\" style=\"perspective: 1000px; will-change: transform, opacity, z-index;\">\n                <img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1566206091558-7f218b696731?ixid=M3w3NTc5NzN8MHwxfHNlYXJjaHwyMnx8ZmFzaGlvbnxlbnwxfDF8fHwxNzcyNjY5NTY0fDA&amp;ixlib=rb-4.1.0&amp;w=320&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format&amp;q=80\" alt=\"Fashion 7\" class=\"w-20 h-28 md:w-28 md:h-36 object-cover rounded-[1.5rem] md:rounded-[2rem] shadow-2xl grayscale-[20%] hover:grayscale-0 transition-all duration-500\" style=\"will-change: transform;\">\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"gallery-item absolute top-1/2 left-1/2\" style=\"perspective: 1000px; will-change: transform, opacity, z-index;\">\n                <img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1584016235603-290a5f94af4a?ixid=M3w3NTc5NzN8MHwxfHNlYXJjaHwyNXx8cG9ydHJhaXR8ZW58MXwyfHx8MTc3MjY2OTU0M3ww&amp;ixlib=rb-4.1.0&amp;w=320&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format&amp;q=80\" alt=\"Fashion 8\" class=\"w-24 h-24 md:w-32 md:h-32 object-cover rounded-[1.5rem] md:rounded-[2rem] shadow-2xl grayscale-[20%] hover:grayscale-0 transition-all duration-500\" style=\"will-change: transform;\">\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </main>\n\n    <!-- Footer Area -->\n    <footer class=\"absolute bottom-6 left-6 right-6 flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-start md:items-end z-40 pointer-events-none\">\n        <div class=\"max-w-2xl pointer-events-auto\">\n            <h1 class=\"text-5xl md:text-7xl lg:text-8xl font-normal tracking-tight leading-[1.05] text-white\">\n                Your vision,\n            </h1>\n            <h1 class=\"text-5xl md:text-7xl lg:text-8xl font-light tracking-tight leading-[1.05] text-gray-500\">\n                instantly realized.\n            </h1>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"mt-8 md:mt-0 pointer-events-auto\">\n            <span class=\"text-xs text-gray-500 uppercase tracking-[0.2em] font-normal\">Scroll down</span>\n        </div>\n    </footer>\n\n    <script>\n        // WebGL-like Background Animation (Canvas)\n        const canvas = document.getElementById('bg-canvas');\n        const ctx = canvas.getContext('2d');\n        let width, height;\n        let particles = [];\n\n        function initCanvas() {\n            width = canvas.width = window.innerWidth;\n            height = canvas.height = window.innerHeight;\n            particles = [];\n            const numParticles = Math.floor((width * height) / 25000);\n            for (let i = 0; i < numParticles; i++) {\n                particles.push({\n                    x: Math.random() * width,\n                    y: Math.random() * height,\n                    vx: (Math.random() - 0.5) * 0.3,\n                    vy: (Math.random() - 0.5) * 0.3\n                });\n            }\n        }\n\n        function animateCanvas() {\n            ctx.clearRect(0, 0, width, height);\n            ctx.strokeStyle = 'rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06)';\n            ctx.lineWidth = 1;\n\n            for (let i = 0; i < particles.length; i++) {\n                let p = particles[i];\n                p.x += p.vx;\n                p.y += p.vy;\n\n                if (p.x < 0 || p.x > width) p.vx *= -1;\n                if (p.y < 0 || p.y > height) p.vy *= -1;\n\n                for (let j = i + 1; j < particles.length; j++) {\n                    let p2 = particles[j];\n                    let dist = Math.hypot(p.x - p2.x, p.y - p2.y);\n                    if (dist < 180) {\n                        ctx.beginPath();\n                        ctx.moveTo(p.x, p.y);\n                        ctx.lineTo(p2.x, p2.y);\n                        ctx.stroke();\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n            requestAnimationFrame(animateCanvas);\n        }\n\n        window.addEventListener('resize', initCanvas);\n        initCanvas();\n        animateCanvas();\n\n        // 3D WebGL-like Orbital Gallery Animation\n        const items = document.querySelectorAll('.gallery-item');\n        let time = 0;\n        let mouseX = 0;\n        let mouseY = 0;\n        let targetX = 0;\n        let targetY = 0;\n\n        document.addEventListener('mousemove', (e) => {\n            mouseX = (e.clientX / window.innerWidth - 0.5) * 2;\n            mouseY = (e.clientY / window.innerHeight - 0.5) * 2;\n        });\n\n        function animateFloat() {\n            time += 0.004; // Speed of the 3D loop\n            targetX += (mouseX - targetX) * 0.05;\n            targetY += (mouseY - targetY) * 0.05;\n\n            items.forEach((item, index) => {\n                // Calculate position in orbit\n                const angle = time + (index / items.length) * Math.PI * 2;\n                const isMobile = window.innerWidth < 768;\n                const radiusX = isMobile ? 130 : 340;\n                const radiusZ = isMobile ? 110 : 280;\n\n                const x = Math.cos(angle) * radiusX;\n                const z = Math.sin(angle) * radiusZ;\n\n                // Add vertical wave for natural floating\n                const y = Math.sin(angle * 2 + index) * (isMobile ? 30 : 80);\n\n                // Calculate depth ratio (0 = back, 1 = front)\n                const depthRatio = (z + radiusZ) / (radiusZ * 2);\n\n                // Front images bigger & opaque, back images smaller & transparent\n                const scale = 0.5 + (depthRatio * 0.7);\n                const opacity = 0.15 + (depthRatio * 0.85);\n\n                // Parallax shift based on depth\n                const pX = targetX * 80 * depthRatio;\n                const pY = targetY * 80 * depthRatio;\n\n                // Apply 3D transforms\n                item.style.transform = `translate3d(calc(-50% + ${x + pX}px), calc(-50% + ${y + pY}px), ${z}px) scale(${scale})`;\n                item.style.opacity = opacity;\n                item.style.zIndex = Math.round(depthRatio * 100);\n\n                // Tilt the images slightly towards the mouse\n                const img = item.querySelector('img');\n                if(img) {\n                    img.style.transform = `rotateX(${-targetY * 15}deg) rotateY(${targetX * 15}deg)`;\n                }\n            });\n            requestAnimationFrame(animateFloat);\n        }\n        animateFloat();\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "instant-digital-content-section.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/regenerated-2026-05-22-2s/instant-digital-content-section.jpg", "source_name": "instant-digital-content-section-DESIGN.md", "views": 108, "forks": 8, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "9109ecbb-cdc4-4815-981e-2ea83be13765", "created_at": "2026-04-29T09:15:30.794547+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-01T22:13:58.683963+00:00"}